<title>NORWAY: Trading resumed again on Oslo bourse.</title>
<headline>Trading resumed again on Oslo bourse.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the Oslo stock exchange resumed on Tuesday afternoon after being interrupted twice for a total of three hours because of technical problems, an Oslo Bourse spokesman said.</p>
<p>Trade in stocks, bonds and fixed income derivatives was interrupted by the problems while trade in share derivatives was left unaffected, he said.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
